      <activity id="177bdad3-1bec-5ba3-913d-953b5554f061" activityNameId="196d85d2-565d-5858-8671-71f4674d37f3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, at production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, at production
Oil production delivers the co-product natural gas. The values are derived from a multioutput-process "combined onshore gas and oil production" by allocation based on heating values for crude oil and natural gas UUID=f0aa84c8-4a36-31d5-adc8-57ea541f14b8
Production of natural gas including energy use, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: Data valid for PE.
Technology: 10 % offshore and  90 % onshore production
Time period: Time of most relevant publications and statistics. Other generic data, e.g. for infrastructure are based on older publications.
Production volume: 15 billion Nm3 natural gas per year in 2023.
Sampling: Statistics and use of generic data
Extrapolations: A part of the data has been estimated with generic assumptions for on- and offshore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f0aa84c8-4a36-31d5-adc8-57ea541f14b8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
